    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Short directions",
     "texto": [
      "To give a formal instruction, you can use **Πηγαίνετε…** («go») and **στρίψτε…** («turn»). **Στα δεξιά** is to the right; **στα αριστερά**, to the left.",
      "In an announcement, first look for the destination, the time and the means of transport. **Αναχώρηση** means departure and **άφιξη** means arrival."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
